        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: تحلیل",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تحلیل (tahlil) — \"an analysis\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تحلیل او از بازی خیلی خوب بود. tahlil-e u az bâzi kheyli khub bud. His analysis of the game was very good."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural tahlilhâ. Tahlilgar — an analyst."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تحلیل (tahlil) is usually traced to Arabic taḥlīl \"analysis\", a verbal noun usually explained as untying or breaking something into its parts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
