              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "برداشت (bardâsht) — \"an impression, an interpretation\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "برداشت من این بود که او ناراحت است. bardâsht-e man in bud ke u nârâhat ast. My impression was that he was upset."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The past stem of bardâshtan \"to pick up\": what you take from something. It is also a harvest."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "برداشت (bardâsht) is native Persian, built from bar \"up, on\" + dâsht, the past stem of dâshtan \"to have, to hold\". It is what you pick up from a text or a meeting."
            }
          ]
        },
