              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نتیجه گیری او منطقی بود. natije giri-ye u manteqi bud. His conclusion was logical."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Natije \"result\" + giri \"taking\", from gereftan. Also the last part of an essay."
