              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اشاره کردن (eshâre kardan) — \"to mention, to refer to\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او در نامه به این مشکل اشاره کرد. u dar nâme be in moshkel eshâre kard. In the letter he mentioned this problem."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Takes be: be chizi eshâre kardan. Literally to make a sign towards something."
            }
          ]
        },
